// Grid

/*
Factory for a grid of equal cells.
newColumns and newRows return a Container.
*/
:doc Grid

/*
Create a grid with the given number of columns.
( cols:i objs:List -- grid:Container )
*/
:doc Grid#newColumns

/*
Create a grid with the given number of rows.
( rows:i objs:List -- grid:Container )
*/
:doc Grid#newRows
